id: instant-craft-second-effect
name: Instant Craft
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: instant-craft
fromEffect: 2
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Instant Craft's second effect, as a Maneuver: a Basic Item made on the spot, gone with the Combat Encounter.
text: >
  (2)-[1/Round]: As an Instant Maneuver, select a Basic Item. Make a Craft Skill Check against the DC for that Basic Item. If you succeed, create that Basic Item. It is destroyed at the end of the Combat Encounter.

---

# Which Basic Item, asked; the Create's card with its Craft Check rolled against that DC - no Time, Scrap or Blueprint -
# and Create item on it; made, gone as the Encounter ends (chat.mjs instantCraft; combat.mjs).
[on used]
instantCraft();
